#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/other.md:4
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;《灵数奇缘》社区伙伴可以复用已创作的游戏资产（文案、美术、配乐、代码、etc），修改设定文案设计新的故事和玩法，创作出不同的游戏作品。更多的项目等待发起中。"
msgstr "&emsp;&emsp;\"Luv Sense Digital\" community partners can reuse created game assets (copywriting, art, music, code, etc.), modify setting copywriting to design new stories and gameplay, and create different game works. More projects are waiting to be initiated."
